    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>In the ruins of the apocalypse, survival is not just a choice but an endless test. This is a multiplayer co-op zombie survival game that immerses you in a world dominated by zombies and harsh environments. You will play as a survivor in the end times, struggling to survive in this hellish world, exploring city ruins, and facing extreme temperature changes and various unknown threats.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/6485488355407096cad8f805de3fbb6b.webp?t=1738830109\" width=615 height=59 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/f0812f7d7aa39458c2f148ea8a05da37.poster.avif?t=1738830109\" width=614 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/f0812f7d7aa39458c2f148ea8a05da37.webm?t=1738830109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/f0812f7d7aa39458c2f148ea8a05da37.mp4?t=1738830109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>One night, your city is hit by a zombie outbreak, turning the entire place into a living hell, while temperatures continue to drop. After surviving the initial chaos, you decide to escape the city and return to your family, embarking on a journey home. Along the way, you will rely on makeshift shelters and weapons to solve the mysteries and find the key to escaping this dire situation.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/c41a6c6cf61ae7c354b23c5e9f04dec1.webp?t=1738830109\" width=615 height=59 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/37177591d8166cd6a2e5b5d0cf98362b.poster.avif?t=1738830109\" width=614 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/37177591d8166cd6a2e5b5d0cf98362b.webm?t=1738830109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/37177591d8166cd6a2e5b5d0cf98362b.mp4?t=1738830109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>You will explore this apocalyptic world alone or with your companions, building safe havens, growing crops to sustain yourself, and repairing vehicles and crafting weapons. Explore dangerous strongholds and ruins, gather resources, and improve your equipment to survive as long as possible in this world filled with zombies and unknown creatures.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>In the ruins of the apocalypse, survival is not just a choice but an endless test. This is a multiplayer co-op zombie survival game that immerses you in a world dominated by zombies and harsh environments. You will play as a survivor in the end times, struggling to survive in this hellish world, exploring city ruins, and facing extreme temperature changes and various unknown threats.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/6485488355407096cad8f805de3fbb6b.webp?t=1738830109\" width=615 height=59 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/f0812f7d7aa39458c2f148ea8a05da37.poster.avif?t=1738830109\" width=614 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/f0812f7d7aa39458c2f148ea8a05da37.webm?t=1738830109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/f0812f7d7aa39458c2f148ea8a05da37.mp4?t=1738830109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>One night, your city is hit by a zombie outbreak, turning the entire place into a living hell, while temperatures continue to drop. After surviving the initial chaos, you decide to escape the city and return to your family, embarking on a journey home. Along the way, you will rely on makeshift shelters and weapons to solve the mysteries and find the key to escaping this dire situation.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/c41a6c6cf61ae7c354b23c5e9f04dec1.webp?t=1738830109\" width=615 height=59 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/37177591d8166cd6a2e5b5d0cf98362b.poster.avif?t=1738830109\" width=614 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/37177591d8166cd6a2e5b5d0cf98362b.webm?t=1738830109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/37177591d8166cd6a2e5b5d0cf98362b.mp4?t=1738830109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>You will explore this apocalyptic world alone or with your companions, building safe havens, growing crops to sustain yourself, and repairing vehicles and crafting weapons. Explore dangerous strongholds and ruins, gather resources, and improve your equipment to survive as long as possible in this world filled with zombies and unknown creatures.</strong>",
    "short_description": "A multiplayer survival game. Players take on the role of survivors in a dire situation, searching for resources, crafting weapons, surviving amidst zombies and unknown dangers, and uncovering the secrets of the catastrophe.",
